<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-extinguisher-classes> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> "Nader Jelassi"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-extinguisher-classes> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Controlled vocabulary of the extinguisher classes applicable to a battery, used as the value set of batlab:extinguishingAgent. Replaces the free-text values of the battery-labeling module. The five classes A, B, C, D and F are those of EN 2:2005, the standard to which BatteryPass-Ready long list attribute 24 pins the determination of the fire class."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-extinguisher-classes> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2026-08-19"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
