<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-extinguisher-classes> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2026-09-01"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-extinguisher-classes> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/references> "EN 2:2005, Classification of fires; BatteryPass-Ready Data Attribute Long List v1.3, attribute 24 (Regulation (EU) 2023/1542, Annex VI Part A (9)); Spherity Battery Pass ontology v0.1, extinguishingAgent"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-extinguisher-classes> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg/2023/1542/oj> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-extinguisher-classes> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "EU DPP Battery Extinguisher Classes Vocabulary"@en .
