<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-extinguisher-classes> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Developed against the CIRPASS-2 CORE ontology v2.0.5 (refresh of 25 August 2026; P_DPP v2.0.6 of 27 August 2026, MAT v1.0.2). External references are pinned to these versions."@en .
