# https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-extinguisher-classes#ClassC
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-extinguisher-classes#ClassC> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-extinguisher-classes#ClassC> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-extinguisher-classes#ClassC> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/references> "Spherity Battery Pass ontology v0.1, extinguishingAgent"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-extinguisher-classes#ClassC> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-extinguisher-classes> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-extinguisher-classes#ClassC> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Extinguisher class C"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-extinguisher-classes#ClassC> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Fires involving flammable gases, per EN 2:2005."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-extinguisher-classes#ClassC> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#editorialNote> "Mapping trap. Under NFPA 10 the same letter denotes fires involving energised electrical equipment. The two readings are not interchangeable, so a value of C taken from a US-sourced data set must not be carried across unchecked."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-extinguisher-classes#ClassC> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-extinguisher-classes#ExtinguisherClassScheme> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-extinguisher-classes#ClassC> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "C" .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-extinguisher-classes#ClassC> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Extinguisher class C"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-extinguisher-classes#ClassC> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#topConceptOf> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-extinguisher-classes#ExtinguisherClassScheme> .
# 
# https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-extinguisher-classes#ClassD
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-extinguisher-classes#ClassD> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-extinguisher-classes#ClassD> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-extinguisher-classes#ClassD> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/references> "Spherity Battery Pass ontology v0.1, extinguishingAgent"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-extinguisher-classes#ClassD> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-extinguisher-classes> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-extinguisher-classes#ClassD> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Extinguisher class D"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-extinguisher-classes#ClassD> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Fires involving combustible metals. Same scope in EN 2:2005 and in NFPA 10; the class most likely to be relevant to lithium battery cells."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-extinguisher-classes#ClassD> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-extinguisher-classes#ExtinguisherClassScheme> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-extinguisher-classes#ClassD> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "D" .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-extinguisher-classes#ClassD> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Extinguisher class D"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-extinguisher-classes#ClassD> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#topConceptOf> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-extinguisher-classes#ExtinguisherClassScheme> .
# 
# https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-extinguisher-classes#ClassF
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-extinguisher-classes#ClassF> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-extinguisher-classes#ClassF> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-extinguisher-classes#ClassF> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/references> "EN 2:2005, Classification of fires; Spherity Battery Pass ontology v0.1, extinguishingAgent"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-extinguisher-classes#ClassF> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-extinguisher-classes> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-extinguisher-classes#ClassF> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Extinguisher class F"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-extinguisher-classes#ClassF> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "K (NFPA 10)"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-extinguisher-classes#ClassF> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Fires involving cooking media (vegetable or animal oils and fats), per EN 2:2005."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-extinguisher-classes#ClassF> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#editorialNote> "Renamed from batext:ClassK on 26 August 2026, when EN 2:2005 was settled as the reference standard in issue #8. Renamed outright rather than deprecated: the namespace has never been published under w3id.org."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-extinguisher-classes#ClassF> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-extinguisher-classes#ExtinguisherClassScheme> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-extinguisher-classes#ClassF> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "F" .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-extinguisher-classes#ClassF> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Extinguisher class F"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-extinguisher-classes#ClassF> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "EN 2:2005 class F and NFPA 10 (US) class K have the same scope. The US letter is kept as skos:altLabel so that data sourced from NFPA 10, such as the Spherity Battery Pass ontology v0.1, still maps onto this concept."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-extinguisher-classes#ClassF> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#topConceptOf> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-extinguisher-classes#ExtinguisherClassScheme> .
# 
# https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-extinguisher-classes#ExtinguisherClassScheme
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-extinguisher-classes#ExtinguisherClassScheme> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-extinguisher-classes#ExtinguisherClassScheme> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#ConceptScheme> .
